{"title": "Context", "description": "Find prior conversations, tasks, decisions, or side effects before acting.", "examples": ["what did we decide last week", "have you already sent it", "review pending tasks"], "events": [], "tools": ["context_search", "job_read", "job_search", "job_list"]}

Use context_search to recall past actions, conversations, or decisions across all data sources. Use job_search and job_read to inspect specific past jobs and their outcomes, outbound emails, and linked reminders or projects.

For pending tasks, use job_list without inventing a search keyword. Follow next_before_id until complete. Read details only for relevant tasks. Do not expand a simple status review into unrelated workspace, memory, configuration, or model inspections. Summarize the requested scope and finish once the evidence is sufficient.
